## Auth (mock)
- Flow `/login` → `/verify` → `/loading` (3s) → protected app; state in `src/context/AuthContext.jsx`, `localStorage` key `mped-auth` = `{ email, name, role, allowed, code, stage: otp|loading|ready }`
- Login email field opens a `demoUsers` picker (mock.js) that auto-fills email + password; **only مشرف الإدارة العامة (`enabled: true`) reaches the dashboard** — the rest show «قيد التطوير» after verification
- Verification code is random per sign-in and types itself digit by digit every 450ms into read-only boxes; confirm/resend disabled while typing; resend countdown 60s; guards in `RequireAuth.jsx` (`STAGE_ROUTE = { otp: "/verify", loading: "/loading" }`)
- `AuthShell.jsx`: frame `min-w-[1100px]`/`max-w-[1920px]` on `#1b1d22`, page bg `#F6F7F8`, `/dots.png` top-right + rotated bottom-left at 34.72% of frame width, opacity 0.6; card **660.8×561.6** radius `26.67px` bg `#E9ECEF` shadow `0 5.33px 5.33px #00000040`, `gap-[35px]`, content column 478.94; logo `/auth-logo.png`
- Inputs 52px white border `#D8D8D8`, icon on the **left**, placeholder `#ADB5BD`; primary buttons height `65.61px` radius `11.72px` bg `#0747A5`; OTP four 58×58 boxes `dir="ltr"`
- `roles` in `mock.js` keeps the 6 role definitions for future flows; signed-in name + role show in the topbar; sidebar تسجيل الخروج calls `signOut()` → `/login`

## General admin module (`/ga`) — isolated clone
- Files: `src/components/ga/GaLayout.jsx` (NAV prefixed `/ga`), `src/pages/ga/*` (copies of the supervisor pages), `src/data/mockGa.js` (`export * from "./mock"` — declare an export locally to diverge), `src/auth/roleHome.js` (`homePathForRole` from `demoUsers[].home`)
- Only touch `src/pages/ga/**`, `src/components/ga/**`, `src/data/mockGa.js` when building general admin; **never** edit the supervisor pages to serve it
- `detailPath` / `backTo` are `/ga/forms` and `/ga/required`

## Cross-module integration — `src/domain/` (isolation is UI-only)
- One product: a request moves between roles, so shared business logic lives in `src/domain/` and is **never** forked per module
- `src/domain/roles.js` `ROLES` (6 labels matching `demoUsers[].role`) · `src/domain/workflow.js` `STAGES` (7 stages, each with its owner role) + `stageIndex` / `stageById` / `ownsStage` / `nextStage` · `src/domain/notes.js` `loadNotes` / `saveNotes` on the single key `mped-notes-${id}`
- Notes are shared between both modules; author = `useAuth().name` (fallback `d.officer`)
- Stage-driven buttons must derive from `STAGES` / `ownsStage(role, stageId)`, not per-page role literals
- `mockGa.js` overrides **presentation only** (KPI labels, chart series, columns); requests / notes / users stay single-sourced
- New writes (create request, advance stage) go into `src/domain/`, called from both modules — no module-scoped storage keys
- Route groups: `RequireAuth allow={["مشرف الإدارة العامة"]}` for `/`, `allow={["الإدارة العامة"]}` for `/ga`; a role outside its module is redirected to its own home
- Still to build from `الإدارة العامة.pdf`: 3 indicator groups + إنشاء طلب بيان, create-statement-form page, 7-stage stepper detail with stage-driven actions, attachments table, الدرجات العلمية matrix, PDF list columns/filters

## Rules of engagement
- Prefer extending existing patterns over new visual systems
- Keep Arabic copy; RTL layout; LTR only for charts/email/phone where already done
- No drive-by refactors of accepted screens while building new pages
